  | 2 => ⟨(204 : ℤ), (-312655017670697883387760425570996071887303352867895997247182 : ℤ), (861875205379763792673627180969324716153092450843291542285715 : ℤ)⟩

theorem V_mem : V.mem (fTop c) := by
